{"title": "Dual Wielder", "pageid": 4937, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dual_Wielder", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder:_Bonus_Armour_Class\" title=\"Dual Wielder: Bonus Armour Class\">Dual Wielder: Bonus Armour Class</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dual_Wielder.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Dual_Wielder.webp/300px-Dual_Wielder.webp, /w/images/6/67/Dual_Wielder.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Dual_Wielder.webp/300px-Dual_Wielder.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Dual_Wielder.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Dual Wielder</b> is a passive feature granted by the <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dual Wielder (Feat)\">Dual Wielder</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">feat</a>. It allows characters to dual wield weapons that are not two-handed even if they aren't <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\">Light</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can use Two-Weapon Fighting even if the weapons you are wielding aren't <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\">Light</a>. You cannot dual wield <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-Handed</a> weapons. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dual Wielder (Feat)\">Dual Wielder (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Allandra_Grey\" title=\"Allandra Grey\">Allandra Grey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Antinia\" title=\"Antinia\">Antinia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arcagh\" title=\"Arcagh\">Arcagh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elenna_Thrinn\" title=\"Elenna Thrinn\">Elenna Thrinn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Qora\" title=\"Qora\">Qora</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skoona\" title=\"Skoona\">Skoona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Minthara\" title=\"Zombie Minthara\">Zombie Minthara</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Normally, a character can only dual wield two weapons with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Light_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Light_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Light_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\">Light</a> property. This feat allows them to dual wield <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/38px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"One-Handed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> One-Handed and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Versatile\" title=\"Versatile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/38px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Versatile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Versatile\" title=\"Versatile\">Versatile</a> weapons as well.</li>\n<li>Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Patch#7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch\">Patch #7</a>, the tooltip stated player characters could not dual wield <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavy\">Heavy</a> weapons, a property that was never implemented in the game.</li>\n<li>During level up, the selected character will always have only one weapon visible at their back, even if two are equipped.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can use Two-Weapon Fighting with any weapons that aren't <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-Handed</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195506\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1039/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8000/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5155/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 667/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 824759/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.627      1 -total\n 97.83%   38.766      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 18.65%    7.391      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.90%    6.698      3 Template:WeaponProperty\n 15.94%    6.316      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.91%    5.908      3 Template:Icon_text\n 13.38%    5.301      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.29%    4.077      1 Template:Light\n 10.23%    4.055      6 Template:Trim\n  9.22%    3.655      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4937-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195506 and revision id 390047. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}